  "rationale": "All eight added columns are variables that lie outside the resolution-duration focus, are knowable at or before resolution (no post-outcome leakage), and each plausibly carries signal about how long resolution takes. The set spans complementary dimensions -- issue type/symptom/scope, temporal open-time features, routing/agent, and caller type -- giving a model meaningful additional leverage beyond the raw columns. Utility is high but not maximal because several features (open_hour_band, opened_day_of_week) are derivable from existing opened_at and thus add limited fresh information, and resolver_match/agent effects may be partly collinear with existing assignment fields."
